 "description": "Know every ZTL before you drive into it.\n\nZTL shows all of Italy's limited traffic zones on one map: 3,000+ camera gates in 470+ cities, color-coded live — red means the restriction is active now, green means you can pass, gray means the schedule is unknown.\n\nWHY ZTL\n• All of Italy in one app: open the map and instantly see gate counts per area\n• Live color-coded pins for every gate, with days and hours\n• Exact zone boundaries: tap any area for its perimeter and hours (OpenStreetMap data)\n• Gate data stored on your device: works even without internet\n• Proximity alerts when you approach an active zone (opt-in)\n• Search any city and jump straight to its gates\n• List view grouped by city, with your favorites on top\n• Look Around preview so you recognize the gate once you're on the road\n• Share any gate with your travel companions in one tap\n• 3 pin styles and a clean map with POI hidden\n• Fast, lightweight, no sign-up. 42 languages\n\nPerfect for tourists, delivery drivers and anyone driving in an unfamiliar Italian city. Avoid fines: check the gate before you cross it.\n\nDownload now and drive with confidence.",
